@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-38 Send Order Status Email

class "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "StatusHistory" as StatusHistory <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : OrderEmailService.send*Email
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> StatusHistory : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses
Service --> "Gmail SMTP" : email notification

note right of UI
UC-38 - Send Order Status Email
Actors: System
Pre: Order status thay đổi
Post: Email được gửi cho khách hàng
end note
@enduml
